#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:9
msgid "Developer experience and provider iteration"
msgstr "开发体验与 provider 迭代"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:11
msgid ""
"This iteration keeps the static factory and shared polymorphic interfaces "
"while reducing unnecessary product and maintenance work. The "
"{download}`75-task execution ledger <developer-experience-execution.csv>` is"
" the task-status authority; its [readable view](../status/ledgers/developer-"
"experience.md) preserves the same fields: W1–W9 contain 63 software work "
"items, I-01–I-06 track integration, and H1–H6 require connected equipment. "
"Implementation, software execution and physical execution are separate "
"columns. A software mechanism does not close a physical exit condition."
msgstr ""
"本轮保留静态 factory 和共享多态接口，减少产品开发与维护中不必要的工作。{download}`75 项执行台账 <developer-"
"experience-execution.csv>` 是任务状态权威；其[可读视图](../status/ledgers/developer-"
"experience.md)保留相同字段：W1–W9 包含63 项软件工作，I-01–I-06 跟踪集成交付，H1–H6 "
"需要连接实物设备。实现、软件执行与实板执行分别记录；软件机制不能关闭物理退出条件。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:20
msgid ""
"The subsequent {download}`delivery-completion ledger <platform-delivery-"
"completion.csv>` and its [readable view](../status/ledgers/platform-"
"delivery-completion.md) remain one follow-up authority. It preserves N01–N14"
" and appends the accepted A01–J04 work breakdown, including X01–X05: "
"complete maintained-mode cold lifecycle, configuration contracts, public "
"consumption, execution efficiency, delivery, HIL and environment recovery. "
"These tasks preserve the original 75-task ledger and its fixed P/E evidence."
" Each row keeps its full exit condition; a migrated peripheral or prepared "
"instrument does not close a whole-family or physical task. Hardware "
"execution and a formal software candidate have separate exits; neither "
"inherits an earlier iteration's status."
msgstr ""
"后续的 {download}`交付完善台账 <platform-delivery-"
"completion.csv>`及其[可读视图](../status/ledgers/platform-delivery-"
"completion.md)继续作为同一后续任务权威。它保留 N01–N14，并追加已接受的 A01–J04 工作分解，包括 "
"X01–X05：全部维护模式的冷态生命周期、配置合同、公共消费、执行效率、交付、HIL 和环境恢复。这些任务保留原 75 项台账及其固定 P/E "
"证据。每行保留完整退出条件；迁移一个外设或准备好仪器，不能关闭整个家族或物理任务。硬件执行与正式软件候选各有独立退出条件，都不继承此前迭代状态。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:31
msgid ""
"The implementation order is coverage and baselines, C lifecycle and "
"configuration contracts, family and cross-controller migration, public "
"recipes, then frozen integration. Tool efficiency, delivery reports and "
"environment recovery can proceed in parallel. Physical execution follows "
"actual station admission. The current architecture diagram still applies: "
"these tasks refine existing mechanisms without adding a runtime layer. "
"Actual status remains in the same CSV; the work breakdown is not another "
"support matrix or a project-wide percentage."
msgstr ""
"实施顺序为覆盖清单与基线、C "
"生命周期与配置合同、家族及跨控制器迁移、公共使用配方，最后冻结集成。工具效率、交付报告与环境恢复可并行推进。物理执行须在真实站点准入后开展。当前架构图仍然适用：这些任务完善既有机制，不增加运行时层。实际状态仍记录在同一"
" CSV 中；工作分解不建立另一份支持矩阵，也不用于计算全项目完成百分比。"

msgid "The {download}`follow-up development index <../delivery/platform-delivery-completion-results.json>` retains its original development observations without relabeling old P/E results. The subsequent {ref}`sealed cold-lifecycle baseline <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>` records the final source, complete gates, fixed examples consumption, offline reproduction and post-merge association. Read the later source-bound observation before interpreting an older pending field; a prepared plan or successful configuration query alone cannot close an exit."
msgstr "{download}`后续开发索引 <../delivery/platform-delivery-completion-results.json>`保留原始开发观察，不重标旧 P/E 结果。其后的{ref}`冷态生命周期封存基线 <sealed-cold-lifecycle-baseline>`记录最终源码、完整门禁、固定示例消费、离线复现及合并后的关联。解释较早 pending 字段前，应先读取后续绑定源码的观察；仅有准备计划或成功配置查询不能关闭退出。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:45
msgid "Boundaries that stay explicit"
msgstr "保持明确的边界"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:47
msgid ""
"The current [architecture diagram](../explanation/platform-architecture.md) "
"still applies. One product TOML becomes immutable typed IR and exact static "
"instances; CMake selects sources. Factory getters return existing readonly "
"faces. Products own execution, storage, private PCB and recovery policy "
"outside this repository. A friendlier command does not create a second "
"configuration or build authority."
msgstr ""
"当前[架构图](../explanation/platform-architecture.md)仍然适用。一份产品 TOML 生成不可变 typed "
"IR 和精确静态实例；CMake 选择源码。factory getter 返回已有只读 face。产品在本仓库之外拥有执行、存储、私有 PCB "
"与恢复策略。更易用的命令不建立第二份配置或构建权威。"

