#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:67
msgid ""
"The H743 DMA2D component lives at "
"`components/soc/stm32/stm32h743_frame_dma2d`. Its public include "
"`nexus/components/frame_dma2d.h` and CMake target stay stable. This is a "
"private source ownership correction, not new multimedia or hardware support."
" Historical records keep the paths belonging to their recorded revisions."
msgstr ""
"H743 DMA2D 组件位于 `components/soc/stm32/stm32h743_frame_dma2d`。公共头文件 "
"`nexus/components/frame_dma2d.h` 与 CMake "
"目标保持稳定。这是私有源码归属修正，不增加多媒体或硬件支持。历史记录保留其对应版本中的路径。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:73
msgid ""
"`explain` now prints a human summary by default; automation must use "
"`--json`. The optional owner observation gains admission facts and changes "
"its public sidecar layout, so source consumers recompile. New helpers do not"
" add mandatory state to every provider, allocate a global registry or "
"release borrowed storage. The [product workflow](../guides/developer-"
"workflow.md) documents these changes."
msgstr ""
"`explain` 现在默认输出人读摘要；自动化必须使用 `--json`。可选 owner 观察增加准入事实并改变公共 sidecar "
"布局，源码消费方需要重新编译。新辅助函数不会向每个 provider "
"添加必需状态、分配全局注册表或释放借用存储。[产品工作流](../guides/developer-workflow.md)说明这些变化。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:79
msgid ""
"Official library reuse is evaluated per exact operation. A library name "
"alone does not determine timing or ownership. The F4 HAL reference is finite"
" USART1 TX with DMA2 Stream7; it is not a production backend or a migration "
"of every mode. For HAL v1.8.5, DMA transfer-error IRQ cleanup uses a bounded"
" `SystemCoreClock / 9600` enable-bit loop. Tick waits occur in separate DMA "
"Init, Abort and PollForTransfer paths. Do not describe every normal finite "
"TX or interrupt-driven abort as a `HAL_GetTick` wait. The [official provider"
" contract](official-stm32-provider.md) retains callback, deadline, single-"
"owner and full-drain obligations."
msgstr ""
"官方库按精确操作评估复用。仅凭库名称不能确定时序或所有权。F4 HAL 参考范围为 USART1 有限 TX 与 DMA2 "
"Stream7；它不是生产后端，也不是全部模式迁移。HAL v1.8.5 的 DMA 传输错误 IRQ 清理使用有界的 `SystemCoreClock"
" / 9600` 使能位轮询；tick 等待位于独立的 DMA Init、Abort 和 PollForTransfer 路径。不能把所有正常有限 TX"
" 或中断式 abort 描述为 `HAL_GetTick` 等待。[官方 provider 合同](official-"
"stm32-provider.md)继续约束 callback、deadline、唯一 owner 和完整排空。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:89
msgid ""
"The current decision retains the single production LL/provider engine and "
"GD32 SPL operation reuse. Actual HAL software behavior, current production "
"ELF costs and non-equivalent ARM handle layouts are recorded separately. The"
" reference does not implement complete NVIC preemption/vector withdrawal, "
"IRQ wake, concurrent RX, cold-start rollback or full platform stop. "
"Promoting it and comparing equivalent complete images are later work; no "
"HAL-versus-LL resource ranking or production replacement is claimed."
msgstr ""
"当前决策保留唯一生产 LL／provider 状态机及 GD32 SPL 操作复用。真实 HAL 软件行为、当前生产 ELF 成本与不等价的 ARM "
"handle 布局分别记录。参考实现尚未实现完整 NVIC 抢占／向量撤回、IRQ 唤醒、并发 "
"RX、冷启动回滚或完整平台停止。升级为生产实现及比较等价完整镜像属于后续工作；本轮不提供 HAL 与 LL 的资源排名，也不声称替换生产实现。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:97
msgid "Close work with observations"
msgstr "以实际观察关闭任务"

msgid "Compare complete execution costs"
msgstr "比较完整执行成本"

msgid "The ordinary behavioral TDD gate first runs the maintained `python tools/dev/dev.py doctor --target contracts` profile. It checks prepared, locked Native/ARM tools before expensive Python and Native suites, without installing tools or requiring Docker. Documentation-only staged changes retain the existing fast path. This preflight neither replaces tests nor establishes software qualification."
msgstr "普通行为变更的 TDD 门禁首先运行维护的 `python tools/dev/dev.py doctor --target contracts` profile。在昂贵的 Python 和 Native suite 之前，检查已准备且锁定的 Native/ARM 工具，不安装工具，也不要求 Docker。仅文档的暂存变更沿用现有快速路径。此预检不代替测试，也不建立软件资格。"

msgid "Use `dev.py timings --compare` only after two independent complete executions of the same maintained formal plan, clean source and dependency pins. Each execution must bind the same verified OCI environment-report bytes using the optional `qualify --environment` input. That binding records observed input identity; it does not prove that checkers ran inside an isolated container. Historical reports without this original binding remain valid for their own executed scope, but cannot be retrofitted into this comparison."
msgstr "只有在相同维护的正式计划、clean 源码和固定依赖上完成两次独立的完整执行后，才使用 `dev.py timings --compare`。每次执行必须通过可选的 `qualify --environment` 输入，绑定相同且已验证的 OCI environment-report 字节。该绑定记录已观察的输入身份，不证明 checker 在隔离容器中运行。缺少这种原始绑定的历史报告仍保留其原执行范围的有效性，但不能事后补入本比较。"

msgid "From the clean platform root, set `NEXUS_MEASUREMENT_ROOT` to a new output parent with adequate capacity, `NEXUS_ENVIRONMENT` to the sealed OCI layout's `environment.json`, and `NEXUS_COLD_CACHE_STATE`/`NEXUS_WARM_CACHE_STATE` to the actual cache preparation descriptions. Prepare the intended cold and warm conditions explicitly before their respective executions. These commands run the complete plan; they do not reuse existing successful test reports:"
msgstr "从 clean 平台根目录执行：将 `NEXUS_MEASUREMENT_ROOT` 设置为容量充足的新输出父目录，将 `NEXUS_ENVIRONMENT` 设置为封存 OCI layout 的 `environment.json`，并将 `NEXUS_COLD_CACHE_STATE`/`NEXUS_WARM_CACHE_STATE` 设置为实际缓存准备说明。在每次执行前显式准备相应 cold 或 warm 条件。以下命令运行完整计划，不复用已有的成功测试报告："

msgid "Both runs must actually complete successfully with the exact plan, stage order, commands, raw streams and independent receipts. Formal plans disable compiler cache; declaring warm preparation does not enable it. The comparison reports the union of original stage-command wall intervals, excluding idle gaps and avoiding nested wall-time sums. Native producer checks additionally validate the current shared build outputs; they do not establish independent historical inner Native XML/artifacts for each cold/warm run. Cache state is declared, not measured cache hits; aggregate CPU, process-tree peak RSS and their deltas remain unknown. A cost comparison is not qualification and cannot qualify changed source. No complete cold/warm measurement is claimed merely because this command exists."
msgstr "两次执行都必须实际完整成功，且计划、阶段顺序、命令、原始输出流和独立 receipt 精确匹配。正式计划禁用编译器缓存；声明 warm 准备不会启用它。比较报告使用原始阶段命令墙钟区间的并集，排除空闲间隔并避免嵌套墙钟时长相加。Native producer 检查还验证当前共享构建输出，不证明每次 cold/warm 执行分别保留独立历史内部 Native XML/产物。缓存状态是声明，不是测得的 cache hit；汇总 CPU、进程树峰值 RSS 及相应差值仍为未知。成本比较不是资格，不能赋予变更后源码资格。命令存在本身不表示完整 cold/warm 测量已执行。"

msgid "Hand off an unsigned local software preview"
msgstr "交接无签名的本地软件预览"

msgid "When hosted Actions is unavailable, the explicit `prepare-local` command (`bundle-local` alias) in `tools/release/delivery.py` assembles a local preview from original complete software execution, SDK/consumer packages, documentation and sealed candidates. `verify-local` independently checks the prepared output. Use the [local preview contract and exact commands](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/release/README.md#explicit-local-software-preview) with a new output directory and the expected clean source commit. Input sources, dependency pins, original completed receipts, SDK identity and candidate/document scope must agree; successful reports are not reused to qualify another source."
msgstr "托管 Actions 不可用时，`tools/release/delivery.py` 中显式的 `prepare-local` 命令（别名 `bundle-local`）从原始完整软件执行、SDK/consumer 包、文档与封存候选装配本地预览。`verify-local` 独立检查准备后的输出。使用[本地预览合同与精确命令](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/release/README.md#explicit-local-software-preview)，选用新输出目录和预期 clean 源码提交。输入源码、固定依赖、原始已结束 receipt、SDK 身份与 candidate/document 范围必须一致；成功报告不复用为其他源码的资格。"

msgid "This path preserves original bytes and restores packages without rebuilding or resealing them. Its trust is `local_observation_no_oidc`, signature status is unsigned and `publication_authorized=false`. It does not fabricate Actions runs, OIDC or a formal release, and it does not weaken the existing publication guards. Actual remote publication remains a separate exit."
msgstr "该路径保留原始字节，恢复包时不重建或重新封存。其 trust 为 `local_observation_no_oidc`，签名状态为 unsigned，且 `publication_authorized=false`。它不伪造 Actions run、OIDC 或正式 release，不削弱现有发布门禁。实际远程发布仍是独立退出。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:99
msgid ""
"The ledger records actual implementation and evidence paths, including "
"limited development tests. The {download}`development result index "
"<../delivery/developer-experience-results.json>` keeps maintained test entry"
" points and observed scope; final PR/CI association is recorded after source"
" commits exist. Final source gates, independent SDK consumption and "
"bilingual documentation have separate integration exits. Do not turn an "
"expected CI run, a template manifest or an old release result into a passed "
"current-source exit."
msgstr ""
"台账记录实际实现与证据路径，包括范围有限的开发测试。{download}`开发结果索引 <../delivery/developer-"
"experience-results.json>` 保留已维护测试入口和观察范围；最终 PR／CI 关联在源码提交产生后记录。最终源码门禁、独立 SDK"
" 消费与双语文档各有集成退出条件。预期的 CI 运行、模板 manifest 或旧版本结果都不能冒充当前源码的通过结果。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:106
msgid ""
"Platform commit P is created before examples lock and gitlink are updated to"
" P. Examples commit E is then recorded with P by the delivery association. "
"Tutorials use an explicit examples-revision variable supplied by that "
"record; neither repository embeds the other repository's future commit. "
"Normal review and publication controls remain in effect."
msgstr ""
"先创建平台提交 P，再将示例源码锁和 gitlink 更新为 P。随后在交付关联中记录示例提交 E 与 "
"P。教程使用该记录提供的显式示例版本变量；两个仓库都不嵌入对方尚未产生的提交。正常评审与发布控制继续生效。"

#: docs/design/developer-experience.md:112
msgid ""
"No physical station is connected for this iteration. H1–H6 remain "
"`not_executed`: launch-board bring-up and tools; serial/SPI/I2C and "
"recovery; IRQ/critical-section latency; continuous DMA/Cache; "
"Flash/watchdog/shutdown; and final physical support sealing. Prepared plans "
"preserve unknown PCB facts, station identity and numeric acceptance limits "
"for later real execution."
msgstr ""
